10                                             # MC/DC for decisions at file scope.  The main program's optree hangs off
11                                             # PL_main_root rather than its CV, and a required file's top-level code runs
12                                             # in an eval CV that owns no optree either, so MC/DC has to find the root
13                                             # of each.  Decisions of two atoms and decisions inside a sub are the
14                                             # controls.
15                                             
16             1                           1   use strict;
               1                               
               1                               
17             1                           1   use warnings;
               1                               
               1                               
